			<name>Lay on Hands (Su)</name>
			<description>You can heal wounds (your own or those of others) by touch. Each day you can use this ability 5 times per day. With one use of this ability, you can heal 3d6 hit points of damage. Using this ability is a standard action, unless you target yourself, in which case it is a swift action. Despite the name of this ability, you only need one free hand to use this ability. Alternatively, you can use this healing power to deal damage to undead creatures, dealing 3d6 points of damage. Using Lay on Hands in this way requires a melee touch attack and doesn't provide an attack of opportunity. Undead do not receive a saving throw against this damage.</description>
			<type>PALADINCLASSFEATURES.SPECIALQUALITY.SUPERNATURAL.LAYONHANDS.LAY ON HANDS</type>
			<associated></associated>
			<count>0</count>
			<aspect>CheckCount: 5, CheckType: Uses per Day, MasterAbility: Lay on Hands</aspect>
			<auto>F</auto>
			<hidden>F</hidden>
			<virtual>F</virtual>
			<category>Special Ability</category>
			<source>Paizo Inc. - Core Rulebook, p.61</source>
		</special_quality>
			<name>Rich Parents</name>
			<description>You were born into a rich family, perhaps even the nobility. Your starting cash increases to 900 gp.</description>
