			<source>Paizo Inc. - Core Rulebook, p.60</source>
		</special_quality>
			<name>Mercy (Staggered) (Su)</name>
			<description>Whenever you use Lay on Hands to heal damage to one target, the target is no longer staggered, unless it is at exactly 0 hit points.</description>
